  "id": "2dcf4363-a43e-4cbd-abc4-5f9627e3a9c3",
  "title": "Unified 3D Gaussian Splatting Frameworks for Realistic Scene Reconstruction",
  "summary": "RealityBridge and CRP-GS introduce advanced methods for 3DGS that address challenges in sparse view synthesis, while LG-HCC improves compression efficiency. Both frameworks enhance 3D reconstruction accuracy and reduce computational demands. OctreeSplat and SplatFlux combine video and 3D models for realistic scene reconstruction, with OctreeSplat focusing on spatially varying Gaussian primitives.",
